		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A gigantic purple cobra with five heads, each a different humanoid. Guards obscure relics and long-dead cities. Stern, proud, cryptic speech.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 5 bite +4 (1d6 + poison) or royal gaze, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Royal Gaze</strong>. Every creature within near who can see naga, CON 15+ or struck blind and deaf.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the humanoid form of one of its five heads.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
